{"availability":"available","full":"comroad/add-to-homescreen-react","name":"add-to-homescreen-react","description":"A React component providing add-to-home-screen functionality for different platforms ","category":"Developer tools","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":35,"created":"2020-06-13T08:39:22Z","updated":"2020-06-11T19:10:01Z","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://as-ideas.github.io/add-to-homescreen-react/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T21:42:30.914Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T21:42:30.914Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T21:42:30.914Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T01:04:38.598Z","stars":0,"forks":35},{"at":"2026-10-08T04:48:32.061Z","stars":0,"forks":35},{"at":"2026-10-10T05:45:33.259Z","stars":0,"forks":35},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:42:30.914Z","stars":0,"forks":35}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A React component providing add-to-home-screen functionality for progressive webapps on different platforms and browsers.","add-to-homescreen-react allows you to easily inform your user that your React application is a PWA and installable on the home screen of your mobile phone or on your desktop. It provides a highly configurable React component named AddToHomeScreen that supports different browsers and platforms. Where possible, browser's native add-to-homescreen functionality is used. Where not, a guidance for the user is shown.","This library is based on the add-to-homescreen project of Chris Love."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/comroad/add-to-homescreen-react/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"da425dd933744528176913b5b61cfefe75725c45d69c1a0bdfa73a8140f17c93","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T01:04:38.722Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T08:24:45.326Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A React component providing add-to-home-screen functionality for progressive webapps on different platforms and browsers.","sourceUrl":"https://github.